  concept: "Authored objective: Safe resistor power.\nAuthored requirement: LED BULB\n
    current \u2264 40 mA. Connection pair LED_Anode and LED_Cathode. Conduction required.\nGeneral
    teaching principle: Resistance, voltage and current are linked by Ohm's law for
    ideal resistors, while power dissipation needs separate evaluation.\nOnly fresh,
    authoritative game evidence can establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: A flow restriction can suggest resistance; unlike a pipe, a resistor follows
    electrical laws.
  diagram: '[Authored setup] -> [Check prerequisites] -> [Observe the game evidence]
    -> [Verify objective]'
  misconception: Current and resistor power cannot be established without voltage/current
    evidence and component values.
